Description: Vajra OS Desktop — complete desktop meta-package
 This meta-package installs the complete Vajra OS desktop experience.
 It pulls in all Vajra core tools, the desktop environment, default
 applications, and system utilities that make up Vajra OS.
 .
 Installing this single package transforms a base Debian/Ubuntu system
 into a full Vajra OS installation with:
 .
  * Vajra core system tools (boot, process, memory, filesystem, device, display)
  * Vajra Security Center (firewall, encryption, audit, antivirus)
  * Vajra Control Center (12-section system settings)
  * Vajra App Store & Package Manager (28 curated apps)
  * Vajra Update Manager (with rollback snapshots)
  * Buddhi AI assistant (अबुद्धि) — India-first AI
  * GNOME or KDE or XFCE desktop environment
  * Curated default applications (all free/open-source)
  * Indian language fonts (Noto Devanagari, Tamil, Bengali, etc.)
 .
 Install with: sudo apt install vajra-desktop
